Project: infra-command-center

Purpose: Provide Cursor with clear, high-signal guidance for coding, reviews, commits, and PRs in this repository. This mirrors prior Claude configuration and adapts it for Cursor.

Development Commands
- Dev: pnpm run dev
- Build: pnpm run build
- Start: pnpm start
- Lint: pnpm run lint

Tech Stack
- Next.js 15.4.6 (App Router, Turbopack)
- React 19.1.0 (RSC)
- TypeScript 5 (strict)
- Tailwind CSS v4
- shadcn/ui + Radix UI + Lucide React
- Motion (Framer Motion) animations
- next-themes (default: light)

Architecture & Routes
- App Router with route groups
- Key structure:
  app/
  - layout.tsx (root layout: theme provider, fonts)
  - page.tsx (landing page)
  - globals.css (Tailwind + theme variables)
  - (dashboard)/ (admin route group without URL segment)
    - layout.tsx (sidebar + dashboard chrome)
    - contract-module

Key Pattern
- The (dashboard) group provides consistent sidebar navigation across admin pages without affecting URLs.

Component & Code Organization
- Prefer feature-based structure when features have ≥3 components, custom hooks, self-contained logic, or their own APIs.
- See: @.cursor/docs/file-structure-guidelines.md for detailed structure guidance
- Recommended feature layout:
  src/features/[feature-name]/
  - components/
  - hooks/
  - services/
  - stores/
  - utils/
  - types/
  - constants/
  - __tests__/
  - index.ts
- Global-only when truly shared:
  - components/ui/ (reusable shadcn/ui)
  - components/ (shared feature components)
  - lib/utils.ts (helpers like cn())

Styling
- Tailwind v4 with @import "tailwindcss" and @theme inline
- Prefer CSS variables for theming; OKLCH color space
- Use class-variance-authority for component variants
- Use cn() from @/lib/utils for className merging
- Font: Inter, sans-serif (load via next/font)
- Header gradient: #003366 → #0055A4
- Status colors: Safe #28A745, At Risk #FFC107, Critical #DC3545
- Card UI: radius 12px, padding 20px
- Light theme only (white/transparent backgrounds)

shadcn/ui Conventions
- RSC-compatible components; add "use client" where required
- Path aliases: @/components, @/lib, @/hooks, @/ui
- Base color: neutral; icons via lucide-react

TypeScript
- Strict mode enabled
- Path mapping: @/* → project root
- Target: ES2017; bundler resolution

Dashboard Components
- AppSidebar: collapsible navigation
- NavMain, NavUser: main nav and user profile

Important Notes
- Root layout may use suppressHydrationWarning for theme switching
- Fonts loaded via next/font (Inter)
- Default theme: light only

Documentation & File Creation
- NEVER create documentation files (*.md, *.txt, README, CHANGELOG, etc.) unless explicitly requested by the user
- NEVER create summary files, migration guides, or overview documents proactively
- Focus on code implementation rather than documentation
- If user wants documentation, they will ask for it specifically
- Exception: Code comments and JSDoc are encouraged for complex logic

Cursor Usage Notes
- Use this file as primary guidance while coding and generating commits/PRs.
- Supplemental references mirrored under .cursor/docs and .cursor/templates.
- When completing tasks, prioritize working code over documentation
